# Contributors

zymposium is authored and maintained by:

- Justin Woodring <jwoodrg@gmail.com> (@JustinWoodring)

zymposium builds on [zest](https://github.com/JustinWoodring/zest), which stages
and builds Zig executables and whose install manifest zymposium reads to find
the skills shipped by installed tools.

Thanks to everyone who has reported issues, suggested features, and helped
sharpen the tool. Contributions of any size are welcome; see
[CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) for how to get started.
